We need to do it together, and we're in it together.

01:01:46.470 --> 01:01:48.290
And, you know, I was like, yeah, I need a team.

01:01:48.370 --> 01:01:49.710
And right now, I have no team, guys.

01:01:50.010 --> 01:01:52.070
Nobody wants to go to college ministry anymore.

01:01:52.410 --> 01:01:58.050
If anybody want to help me, all right, if you don't have anything to do for one year, look me up.

01:01:58.790 --> 01:02:00.790
Okay, but if you're a troublemaker, stay here.

01:02:01.190 --> 01:02:05.570
But if you want to be Christ-like, come and join me, all right?

01:02:05.710 --> 01:02:08.310
If you want to be a missionary, I have a great mission field.

01:02:08.310 --> 01:02:15.990
New Jersey okay and then actually if the Lord wills New Jersey and then possibly Columbia in

01:02:15.990 --> 01:02:21.230
New York and I don't I can't go into all that and so Pastor Barry was saying partnership and I felt

01:02:21.230 --> 01:02:25.870
like I was saying you need to cultivate that partnership you can't do it alone and then

01:02:25.870 --> 01:02:33.030
actually Pastor Dave spoke on Sunday and you have to understand I've known him since freshman year

01:02:33.030 --> 01:02:40.410
i let him actually babysit my kids one time him and another guy uh that was a freshman or they

01:02:40.410 --> 01:02:45.410
were like juniors and they're babysitting like i was upstairs there my daughter is crying

01:02:45.410 --> 01:02:52.010
i go down and the two guys made my kids cry what'd you do and then dave's like i'm sorry

01:02:52.010 --> 01:02:57.730
it's a long story but they did something silly my daughter cried i've known him for so long

01:02:57.730 --> 01:03:01.710
and as he was preaching, I was getting so blessed.

01:03:02.590 --> 01:03:04.910
But one of the things he said that really struck,

01:03:05.170 --> 01:03:08.590
he was talking about the precious pearl, the hidden treasure.

01:03:09.050 --> 01:03:12.110
And he said, you know, these men that found the hidden treasure

01:03:12.110 --> 01:03:14.510
and the joy, Jesus Christ, relationship with Christ,

01:03:14.850 --> 01:03:19.390
treasures of heaven, he said, they sold everything with joy.

01:03:22.310 --> 01:03:26.410
And I would say, actually, in my journey of Christian work and life,

01:03:26.410 --> 01:03:30.290
if I say that one of the things that I was weak at

01:03:30.290 --> 01:03:34.330
is I was kind of weak at showing the joy

01:03:34.330 --> 01:03:37.910
of the Lord. Because

01:03:37.910 --> 01:03:42.370
Pastor Dave said

01:03:42.370 --> 01:03:46.170
something. He said, you know, he had become a Christian at GCC his

01:03:46.170 --> 01:03:50.310
first year as a freshman. And he never had a real

01:03:50.310 --> 01:03:54.190
pastor. So I was his only sample of a

01:03:54.190 --> 01:04:00.130
pastor for the first three years of his Christian family life. And he said, Pastor Young, when I was

01:04:00.130 --> 01:04:08.530
a freshman to junior, he was so serious. So serious about that. You should be serious about

01:04:08.530 --> 01:04:15.350
the gospel, amen? I was so serious. He said, Pastor Young became a lot funnier. He became a lot chill

01:04:15.350 --> 01:04:19.650
about it. And I was like, no, man, I was funny when you were in college. He's like, no, you weren't.

01:04:19.650 --> 01:04:26.090
You know, it's like all of it was die, you know, sacrifice, you know, like we got to die.

01:04:26.450 --> 01:04:34.250
And I said, man, this time when I get called to help college students, there's sacrifice.

01:04:35.050 --> 01:04:41.290
There is dying to self, but there is joy in the Lord.

01:04:42.210 --> 01:04:42.870
And you know what?

01:04:42.890 --> 01:04:47.450
I want to grow old being marked by joy.

01:04:47.450 --> 01:04:52.210
and I want to call

01:04:52.210 --> 01:04:53.470
HMCC

01:04:53.470 --> 01:04:56.710
let's unite together

01:04:56.710 --> 01:04:59.390
let's fight the spiritual battle together

01:04:59.390 --> 01:05:01.130
let's raise

01:05:01.130 --> 01:05:03.350
future leaders

01:05:03.350 --> 01:05:04.250
in the Lord

01:05:04.250 --> 01:05:06.030
together

01:05:06.030 --> 01:05:08.990
and let's have

01:05:08.990 --> 01:05:10.430
fun doing it, amen

01:05:10.430 --> 01:05:13.290
it's going to be hard, it's going to be

01:05:13.290 --> 01:05:15.130
sacrifice, but let's have fun

01:05:15.130 --> 01:05:19.140
doing it, HMCC family

01:05:19.140 --> 01:05:21.080
we welcome you

01:05:21.080 --> 01:05:22.840
we are so thankful

01:05:22.840 --> 01:05:26.140
that God brought you to join us

01:05:26.140 --> 01:05:28.560
because we're going to have some fun

01:05:28.560 --> 01:05:36.990
dying, living for the gospel.

01:05:37.910 --> 01:05:38.550
Let's all rise.

01:05:41.000 --> 01:05:43.400
I'm going to pray and then Pastor Pete is going to

01:05:43.400 --> 01:05:45.320
take over and give us the benediction.

01:05:47.880 --> 01:05:50.280
Lord, I thank you for this family

01:05:50.280 --> 01:05:53.840
and I pray for any who feel not belong

01:05:53.840 --> 01:05:58.220
that they will know God, you placed them here

01:05:58.220 --> 01:06:03.550
and that they can belong to this family.

01:06:04.110 --> 01:06:07.850
I pray that HMCC will keep fighting the good fight,

01:06:07.950 --> 01:06:08.850
the spiritual fight,

01:06:08.850 --> 01:06:11.410
not a fight with one another,

01:06:12.110 --> 01:06:14.270
not just the visible fight,

01:06:14.690 --> 01:06:15.750
but the fight in prayer,

01:06:16.350 --> 01:06:17.910
the fight in obeying your word,

01:06:18.530 --> 01:06:19.670
the fight in worship,

01:06:20.190 --> 01:06:22.150
the fight in becoming like Christ

01:06:22.150 --> 01:06:25.230
to demolish the strongholds of the enemy.

01:06:25.730 --> 01:06:27.230
I pray for HMCC, Lord,

01:06:27.230 --> 01:06:31.510
that this church, as it has already done for 30 years,

01:06:31.830 --> 01:06:36.410
will continue to raise up future disciples of Christ.

01:06:37.350 --> 01:06:40.610
I pray for blessing, not just in the college and young adult ministry,

01:06:41.130 --> 01:06:43.230
but in their youth, in their children,

01:06:44.270 --> 01:06:50.290
that generations of believers will flow out of HMCC.

01:06:50.290 --> 01:07:02.970
see. And Lord, I pray that in all sometimes difficulties and bruises and that we will still

01:07:02.970 --> 01:07:10.990
find the joy of the Lord. Thank you that we can do this together. In Jesus' name, amen.
